1
00:01:26,545 --> 00:01:31,325
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:58,345 --> 00:01:59,965
He Du.

3
00:02:08,105 --> 00:02:10,005
We agreed on this hour.

4
00:02:11,105 --> 00:02:12,525
Why hasn't he come yet?

5
00:02:34,345 --> 00:02:35,881
Do you know what crime you have committed

6
00:02:35,905 --> 00:02:37,161
by trespassing here
and disturbing His Majesty?

7
00:02:37,185 --> 00:02:38,481
What punishment do you deserve?

8
00:02:38,505 --> 00:02:39,805
Your Majesty.

9
00:02:40,185 --> 00:02:42,001
I came by order of the Left Chancellor

10
00:02:42,025 --> 00:02:43,201
to present tea to Your Majesty.

11
00:02:43,225 --> 00:02:44,841
For this cup of tea,

12
00:02:44,865 --> 00:02:46,281
I was careful every step of the way,

13
00:02:46,305 --> 00:02:48,245
hoping Your Majesty could taste it.

14
00:02:48,505 --> 00:02:49,965
But the moment I saw Your Majesty,

15
00:02:50,665 --> 00:02:52,121
I panicked

16
00:02:52,145 --> 00:02:53,561
and accidentally fell into the water.

17
00:02:53,585 --> 00:02:55,161
I meant no offense.

18
00:02:55,185 --> 00:02:56,685
Your Majesty,

19
00:02:59,185 --> 00:03:01,365
Ruomei is not a frivolous woman.

20
00:03:02,145 --> 00:03:03,285
I merely...

21
00:03:04,385 --> 00:03:06,001
I have admired Your Majesty
for a long time.

22
00:03:06,025 --> 00:03:07,601
What have you put on your body?

23
00:03:07,625 --> 00:03:09,325
Was this also arranged
by the Left Chancellor?

24
00:03:10,625 --> 00:03:12,321
Serving Your Majesty in the palace

25
00:03:12,345 --> 00:03:14,045
has always been Ruomei's greatest wish.

26
00:03:14,305 --> 00:03:15,841
The Left Chancellor saw

27
00:03:15,865 --> 00:03:17,441
how deeply devoted I am to Your Majesty,

28
00:03:17,465 --> 00:03:18,721
so he intended to bring us together.

29
00:03:18,745 --> 00:03:19,641
Absurd.

30
00:03:19,665 --> 00:03:22,401
I beg Your Majesty to take
pity on my sincere heart

31
00:03:22,425 --> 00:03:24,401
and allow me to enter the
palace and serve you.

32
00:03:24,425 --> 00:03:26,725
I will spare your life today.

33
00:03:27,905 --> 00:03:29,165
Now get out.

34
00:03:32,785 --> 00:03:33,925
Your Majesty.

35
00:03:34,145 --> 00:03:35,641
By coming here tonight,

36
00:03:35,665 --> 00:03:37,361
I have already defied every
rule of propriety.

37
00:03:37,385 --> 00:03:38,641
If I am now

38
00:03:38,665 --> 00:03:40,641
driven out in disarray,

39
00:03:40,665 --> 00:03:42,361
rumors will spread everywhere.

40
00:03:42,385 --> 00:03:44,041
My reputation will be ruined,

41
00:03:44,065 --> 00:03:45,645
and I may no longer
have a place in this world.

42
00:03:45,905 --> 00:03:47,281
When you resorted to such a scheme,

43
00:03:47,305 --> 00:03:50,045
you should have foreseen this outcome.

44
00:03:50,305 --> 00:03:51,201
Get out!

45
00:03:51,225 --> 00:03:53,685
Then Ruomei can only die
to atone for her offense.

46
00:03:55,665 --> 00:03:56,805
If you wish to die,

47
00:03:57,265 --> 00:03:58,361
go die far away from me.

48
00:03:58,385 --> 00:03:59,641
Chief Steward You.

49
00:03:59,665 --> 00:04:01,445
Your Majesty.

50
00:04:01,705 --> 00:04:02,965
You must not.

51
00:04:03,225 --> 00:04:04,601
Are you helping the Left Chancellor

52
00:04:04,625 --> 00:04:06,441
plot against me?

53
00:04:06,465 --> 00:04:07,441
Please calm your anger, Your Majesty.

54
00:04:07,465 --> 00:04:10,365
-Everything I did today was for Your Majesty.
-Enough.

55
00:04:11,905 --> 00:04:13,361
Your Majesty.

56
00:04:13,385 --> 00:04:14,525
Your Majesty.

57
00:04:14,905 --> 00:04:16,445
Your Majesty.

58
00:05:25,665 --> 00:05:26,921
Your Majesty.

59
00:05:26,945 --> 00:05:28,001
The rain is growing heavier.

60
00:05:28,025 --> 00:05:29,605
We should return to the palace at once.

61
00:05:36,225 --> 00:05:37,921
You dare lay hands on court officials?

62
00:05:37,945 --> 00:05:39,241
What audacity!

63
00:05:39,265 --> 00:05:41,401
Don't try to intimidate
us with your official status.

64
00:05:41,425 --> 00:05:42,641
Now that you're in our hands,

65
00:05:42,665 --> 00:05:44,201
you'll do as we say.

66
00:05:44,225 --> 00:05:45,201
I hear Official Meng

67
00:05:45,225 --> 00:05:47,121
is a woman even His Majesty favors.

68
00:05:47,145 --> 00:05:50,081
Tonight, we want to play emperor too.

69
00:05:50,105 --> 00:05:51,841
Take one more step,

70
00:05:51,865 --> 00:05:53,485
and I'll take your filthy lives.

71
00:05:55,545 --> 00:05:57,605
You bitch! How dare you hit me?

72
00:06:00,665 --> 00:06:02,081
-Feisty.
-Let go of me!

73
00:06:02,105 --> 00:06:03,041
Let's see

74
00:06:03,065 --> 00:06:04,925
-how long you can keep struggling.
-Let go of me!

75
00:06:07,385 --> 00:06:08,805
Let go of me!

76
00:06:08,985 --> 00:06:10,405
Let go!

77
00:06:13,305 --> 00:06:14,681
Come on, Official Meng.

78
00:06:14,705 --> 00:06:15,885
Official Meng.

79
00:06:41,865 --> 00:06:42,801
I like women

80
00:06:42,825 --> 00:06:44,241
with a fiery temper like yours.

81
00:06:44,265 --> 00:06:46,921
-They say Official Meng cares deeply for the people.
-Let go of me!

82
00:06:46,945 --> 00:06:49,241
Today, you can show

83
00:06:49,265 --> 00:06:50,805
the two of us some special care.

84
00:06:52,585 --> 00:06:54,245
Come on.

85
00:07:06,625 --> 00:07:08,605
Brother, are you all right?

86
00:07:14,265 --> 00:07:16,325
Don't let her escape! Hold her down!

87
00:07:20,585 --> 00:07:21,881
Run, Official Meng.

88
00:07:21,905 --> 00:07:24,125
Let's see where you can go.

89
00:07:48,745 --> 00:07:51,125
Witchcraft!

90
00:08:14,625 --> 00:08:15,885
My lord.

91
00:08:22,385 --> 00:08:23,441
My lord.

92
00:08:23,465 --> 00:08:24,605
What happened?

93
00:08:30,065 --> 00:08:31,205
Yin Qing.

94
00:08:39,785 --> 00:08:40,925
Enough.

95
00:08:41,745 --> 00:08:42,885
Return to the palace.

96
00:08:43,625 --> 00:08:44,765
Your Majesty.

97
00:08:46,665 --> 00:08:48,045
Your Majesty.

98
00:08:49,625 --> 00:08:51,005
Your Majesty, something has happened.

99
00:08:51,265 --> 00:08:53,201
On her way back to the
Bureau of Intelligence,

100
00:08:53,225 --> 00:08:54,645
Official Meng was attacked by villains.

101
00:09:07,425 --> 00:09:08,801
Your Majesty.

102
00:09:08,825 --> 00:09:10,081
Sister Zhili said

103
00:09:10,105 --> 00:09:11,485
Official Meng does not wish to see anyone.

104
00:09:13,745 --> 00:09:14,965
Captain Di.

105
00:09:15,625 --> 00:09:17,725
Even if you have to turn
the earth upside down,

106
00:09:18,385 --> 00:09:21,125
find that villain for me.

107
00:09:40,185 --> 00:09:41,645
Miss.

108
00:09:42,905 --> 00:09:43,881
Miss.

109
00:09:43,905 --> 00:09:45,961
You have gone without sleep for days
while caring for the Master.

110
00:09:45,985 --> 00:09:47,041
You have already worked hard enough.

111
00:09:47,065 --> 00:09:49,401
Let me prepare the tea and medicine.

112
00:09:49,425 --> 00:09:50,441
Xi'er.

113
00:09:50,465 --> 00:09:51,361
Father has been

114
00:09:51,385 --> 00:09:52,641
in a constant daze these past few days.

115
00:09:52,665 --> 00:09:54,281
He cannot even swallow his medicine.

116
00:09:54,305 --> 00:09:56,161
I had a renowned physician
prescribe a special remedy.

117
00:09:56,185 --> 00:09:58,605
We must find a way to
make him drink it today.

118
00:09:59,225 --> 00:10:00,485
Miss.

119
00:10:02,345 --> 00:10:04,001
Miss Yan.

120
00:10:04,025 --> 00:10:05,441
Congratulations!

121
00:10:05,465 --> 00:10:07,605
This is truly a match made in Heaven.

122
00:10:09,345 --> 00:10:10,485
Xi'er,

123
00:10:14,345 --> 00:10:15,485
what is this?

124
00:10:16,385 --> 00:10:18,041
Master Yan.

125
00:10:18,065 --> 00:10:19,205
Master.

126
00:10:19,545 --> 00:10:20,681
The Song family's betrothal
gifts have arrived.

127
00:10:20,705 --> 00:10:21,681
They are all here.

128
00:10:21,705 --> 00:10:23,441
I have been bedridden
for over half a month,

129
00:10:23,465 --> 00:10:26,245
but seeing these gifts has
made me feel much better.

130
00:10:26,425 --> 00:10:27,801
The fortune-teller was right.

131
00:10:27,825 --> 00:10:29,925
A wedding to bring good
fortune truly works wonders.

132
00:10:30,185 --> 00:10:31,121
Father.

133
00:10:31,145 --> 00:10:33,085
Do you know how worried I have been?

134
00:10:33,345 --> 00:10:35,641
I abandoned my business in
the capital and rushed home,

135
00:10:35,665 --> 00:10:37,561
yet you feigned illness to
trick me into marrying.

136
00:10:37,585 --> 00:10:39,641
Would you have returned
if I had not pretended?

137
00:10:39,665 --> 00:10:42,521
Was the Bofeng House in
Shazhou not enough for you?

138
00:10:42,545 --> 00:10:44,205
You just had to follow
Meng Tinghui to the capital.

139
00:10:44,465 --> 00:10:46,441
I went to the capital for
more than just Mengmeng.

140
00:10:46,465 --> 00:10:49,161
-I have ambitions of my own.
-What ambitions?

141
00:10:49,185 --> 00:10:50,801
News that Meng Tinghui
killed a man in the street

142
00:10:50,825 --> 00:10:52,281
has already reached Shazhou.

143
00:10:52,305 --> 00:10:53,481
If you keep associating with her,

144
00:10:53,505 --> 00:10:55,245
who will ever marry you?

145
00:10:55,705 --> 00:10:57,965
Husband, calm down.

146
00:10:58,265 --> 00:11:00,761
I heard the Bofeng House in the capital

147
00:11:00,785 --> 00:11:02,321
is using Meng Tinghui's name

148
00:11:02,345 --> 00:11:03,881
and doing remarkably well.

149
00:11:03,905 --> 00:11:05,201
Our Fuzhi

150
00:11:05,225 --> 00:11:07,521
may deal with men all day,

151
00:11:07,545 --> 00:11:09,881
but she truly has a gift for business.

152
00:11:09,905 --> 00:11:12,321
No matter how high an
office Meng Tinghui holds,

153
00:11:12,345 --> 00:11:14,045
the Yan family does not care.

154
00:11:14,305 --> 00:11:16,325
Besides, a daughter of the Yan family

155
00:11:16,585 --> 00:11:18,001
has no need to show her face in public.

156
00:11:18,025 --> 00:11:20,001
It is utterly disgraceful.

157
00:11:20,025 --> 00:11:21,285
Father.

158
00:11:21,825 --> 00:11:24,401
You taught me to read
account books as a child

159
00:11:24,425 --> 00:11:26,521
and praised my talent for business.

160
00:11:26,545 --> 00:11:29,041
Now I have the Bofeng House
running smoothly

161
00:11:29,065 --> 00:11:30,241
and have expanded our trade.

162
00:11:30,265 --> 00:11:31,805
What have I done wrong?

163
00:11:32,185 --> 00:11:33,761
I do not ask you to praise me,

164
00:11:33,785 --> 00:11:35,765
but you cannot belittle me either.

165
00:11:38,825 --> 00:11:41,085
-Fuzhi.
-What trick are you trying now?

166
00:11:42,105 --> 00:11:43,685
Fuzhi.

167
00:11:43,865 --> 00:11:45,681
Your father is only
thinking of your future.

168
00:11:45,705 --> 00:11:46,961
Look.

169
00:11:46,985 --> 00:11:48,601
The betrothal gifts have
already been accepted.

170
00:11:48,625 --> 00:11:50,641
Do not make things difficult for him.

171
00:11:50,665 --> 00:11:52,201
We know the Song family well.

172
00:11:52,225 --> 00:11:53,441
They are wealthy,

173
00:11:53,465 --> 00:11:55,881
and they have shown sincerity for years.

174
00:11:55,905 --> 00:11:59,121
Once you marry, our two
families can unite their businesses.

175
00:11:59,145 --> 00:12:00,881
That would be far better than you

176
00:12:00,905 --> 00:12:02,845
fooling around alone in the capital.

177
00:12:03,065 --> 00:12:04,041
As I see it,

178
00:12:04,065 --> 00:12:06,601
the Song family wanted to
protect its own business

179
00:12:06,625 --> 00:12:08,241
and secretly gave you plenty of benefits.

180
00:12:08,265 --> 00:12:10,681
That is why you incited
Father to force me into marriage.

181
00:12:10,705 --> 00:12:12,401
You have wronged me!

182
00:12:12,425 --> 00:12:13,321
Father.

183
00:12:13,345 --> 00:12:15,485
All she wants is to marry me off

184
00:12:15,745 --> 00:12:17,241
so she can seize the Yan family estate,

185
00:12:17,265 --> 00:12:18,601
then leave all this dowry

186
00:12:18,625 --> 00:12:19,845
to her own son.

187
00:12:20,465 --> 00:12:21,561
And you?

188
00:12:21,585 --> 00:12:24,165
Have you ever truly considered
your daughter's happiness?

189
00:12:24,865 --> 00:12:26,761
If Mother were still alive,

190
00:12:26,785 --> 00:12:28,685
she would never force me like this.

191
00:12:31,825 --> 00:12:32,721
Fuzhi.

192
00:12:32,745 --> 00:12:33,921
-Father.
-Husband.

193
00:12:33,945 --> 00:12:35,121
Everything I have done

194
00:12:35,145 --> 00:12:37,401
was in hope that Fuzhi
would soon start a family

195
00:12:37,425 --> 00:12:39,161
and bring you the joy of
children and grandchildren.

196
00:12:39,185 --> 00:12:41,761
I never imagined Fuzhi
would think so poorly of me.

197
00:12:41,785 --> 00:12:43,161
All these years,

198
00:12:43,185 --> 00:12:44,441
I have managed this household

199
00:12:44,465 --> 00:12:46,001
and exhausted myself for this family,

200
00:12:46,025 --> 00:12:48,485
only to receive such resentment.

201
00:12:48,625 --> 00:12:50,241
-Father.
-Enough.

202
00:12:50,265 --> 00:12:51,641
Cancel this marriage.

203
00:12:51,665 --> 00:12:53,565
Then go cancel it.

204
00:12:53,905 --> 00:12:55,965
I said I will not marry him,
and that is final.

205
00:12:57,065 --> 00:12:58,445
Stop her!

206
00:12:59,145 --> 00:13:00,685
Take Fuzhi back to her room.

207
00:13:00,905 --> 00:13:02,201
Stand guard outside.

208
00:13:02,225 --> 00:13:05,081
Without my order,
she is not to take a single step out.

209
00:13:05,105 --> 00:13:06,641
How long do you intend to lock me up?

210
00:13:06,665 --> 00:13:08,765
Until the day you marry.

211
00:13:09,345 --> 00:13:10,921
Regarding this marriage,

212
00:13:10,945 --> 00:13:12,885
should we not discuss it further?

213
00:13:13,905 --> 00:13:15,485
If Fuzhi is unwilling,

214
00:13:15,665 --> 00:13:16,681
perhaps we should let it go.

215
00:13:16,705 --> 00:13:18,405
The longer we wait, the more may go wrong.

216
00:13:18,705 --> 00:13:21,401
Use the auspicious date chosen by
the Song family. The sooner, the better.

217
00:13:21,425 --> 00:13:23,205
Three days from now is auspicious.

218
00:13:25,265 --> 00:13:27,321
Good. The wedding will
be held in three days.

219
00:13:27,345 --> 00:13:29,441
Without Meng Tinghui,

220
00:13:29,465 --> 00:13:30,921
let us see who will come to your aid.

221
00:13:30,945 --> 00:13:32,481
Lock her up.

222
00:13:32,505 --> 00:13:33,925
Let go of me!

223
00:13:43,625 --> 00:13:44,601
Teacher.

224
00:13:44,625 --> 00:13:45,845
Why are you here?

225
00:13:47,345 --> 00:13:48,601
After what happened to Meng Tinghui,

226
00:13:48,625 --> 00:13:50,801
I imagined you must have been terrified.

227
00:13:50,825 --> 00:13:52,685
I heard you have not
returned home for several nights,

228
00:13:53,065 --> 00:13:55,125
and have been searching
the Bureau's case files

229
00:13:55,345 --> 00:13:56,601
for clues to the bandits' whereabouts.

230
00:13:56,625 --> 00:13:58,365
I still cannot believe

231
00:13:58,705 --> 00:14:00,481
that such a good person as Official Meng

232
00:14:00,505 --> 00:14:02,285
could suffer something like this.

233
00:14:02,745 --> 00:14:05,081
I despise those evildoers.

234
00:14:05,105 --> 00:14:07,765
I wish lightning would strike
every one of them dead.

235
00:14:08,665 --> 00:14:10,001
People like them

236
00:14:10,025 --> 00:14:11,281
deserve to have their bloodline end

237
00:14:11,305 --> 00:14:12,445
and to meet a miserable fate.

238
00:14:16,385 --> 00:14:18,161
When did you become as
sharp-tongued as Meng Tinghui?

239
00:14:18,185 --> 00:14:19,161
Your words are merciless.

240
00:14:19,185 --> 00:14:21,365
I merely said what everyone is thinking.

241
00:14:21,625 --> 00:14:23,321
They used such vicious means

242
00:14:23,345 --> 00:14:24,925
to harm a defenseless woman.

243
00:14:25,465 --> 00:14:26,761
How despicable.

244
00:14:26,785 --> 00:14:27,965
Now,

245
00:14:28,345 --> 00:14:30,485
Official Meng has locked
herself in her room

246
00:14:30,785 --> 00:14:32,205
and refuses to see anyone.

247
00:14:32,905 --> 00:14:35,165
I am truly afraid she may
do something reckless.

248
00:14:47,425 --> 00:14:49,045
Fortunately, you were not harmed.

249
00:15:29,265 --> 00:15:32,365
Leyan, there is something
I wish to discuss with you.

250
00:15:32,625 --> 00:15:34,001
The Left Chancellor has always spoken

251
00:15:34,025 --> 00:15:35,205
against Meng Tinghui.

252
00:15:35,465 --> 00:15:37,201
Now that her reputation has been damaged,

253
00:15:37,225 --> 00:15:39,601
he will surely seize the opportunity

254
00:15:39,625 --> 00:15:41,045
to suppress the Bureau of Intelligence.

255
00:15:41,665 --> 00:15:44,445
If Meng Tinghui can no
longer remain its Director,

256
00:15:44,705 --> 00:15:46,561
I have an idea.

257
00:15:46,585 --> 00:15:48,325
I will recommend you to His Majesty

258
00:15:48,625 --> 00:15:50,285
to take over as Director.

259
00:15:50,945 --> 00:15:52,645
You mean

260
00:15:53,225 --> 00:15:54,965
you want me to replace Official Meng?

261
00:15:57,025 --> 00:15:58,121
I cannot do that.

262
00:15:58,145 --> 00:15:59,605
Teacher, do you realize

263
00:16:00,105 --> 00:16:02,205
how difficult things are for
Official Meng right now?

264
00:16:02,945 --> 00:16:04,601
The mere thought of it

265
00:16:04,625 --> 00:16:06,565
makes my heart ache.

266
00:16:08,625 --> 00:16:10,681
I cannot entertain such a thought

267
00:16:10,705 --> 00:16:12,325
when she is at her most vulnerable.

268
00:16:12,585 --> 00:16:13,725
Silly child.

269
00:16:14,305 --> 00:16:16,241
Do you think I do not feel
pain for her too?

270
00:16:16,265 --> 00:16:18,161
But I have always believed

271
00:16:18,185 --> 00:16:20,081
the Bureau of Intelligence
needs a woman like you,

272
00:16:20,105 --> 00:16:21,521
both virtuous and talented,

273
00:16:21,545 --> 00:16:22,961
to preserve its integrity.

274
00:16:22,985 --> 00:16:25,525
You are more suited to be
Director than Meng Tinghui.

275
00:16:25,825 --> 00:16:27,405
Now that this has happened to her,

276
00:16:27,625 --> 00:16:29,001
you must shoulder everything alone.

277
00:16:29,025 --> 00:16:30,481
It pains me to see you bear such a burden,

278
00:16:30,505 --> 00:16:31,961
so I wish to lend you my support

279
00:16:31,985 --> 00:16:33,361
and preserve the Bureau of Intelligence,

280
00:16:33,385 --> 00:16:35,325
into which you and His Majesty
poured so much effort.

281
00:16:35,585 --> 00:16:37,885
When Official Meng first upheld the Bureau,

282
00:16:38,265 --> 00:16:39,161
how many people questioned

283
00:16:39,185 --> 00:16:40,845
whether women could
shoulder great responsibility?

284
00:16:41,065 --> 00:16:42,841
Now that she is in distress,

285
00:16:42,865 --> 00:16:44,841
you want me to seize her authority.

286
00:16:44,865 --> 00:16:46,041
How can that be called preservation?

287
00:16:46,065 --> 00:16:47,685
You have always understood reason.

288
00:16:48,185 --> 00:16:50,761
Why can you not see my
deeper intention today?

289
00:16:50,785 --> 00:16:53,001
It would be best if the Left
Chancellor did nothing,

290
00:16:53,025 --> 00:16:53,961
but what if that day truly comes?

291
00:16:53,985 --> 00:16:56,205
What then?

292
00:17:15,145 --> 00:17:17,445
The Bureau of Intelligence has meaning

293
00:17:17,945 --> 00:17:19,805
only while Official Meng remains in it.

294
00:17:20,865 --> 00:17:22,241
If you truly wish to help me,

295
00:17:22,265 --> 00:17:24,841
then no matter what the
Left Chancellor does,

296
00:17:24,865 --> 00:17:26,165
you will stand with me.

297
00:17:28,065 --> 00:17:30,405
I am willing to advance and
retreat together with Official Meng.

298
00:17:31,785 --> 00:17:33,125
As for this office,

299
00:17:33,745 --> 00:17:35,085
I can do without it.

300
00:17:58,265 --> 00:18:00,205
I failed in my duty.

301
00:18:00,545 --> 00:18:02,285
I failed to protect you.

302
00:19:11,745 --> 00:19:12,925
Your Majesty,

303
00:19:14,305 --> 00:19:16,605
would you teach me how to defend myself?

304
00:20:19,545 --> 00:20:21,925
-Please come inside.
-Right this way.

305
00:20:28,825 --> 00:20:30,201
-Congratulations.
-Congratulations to you as well.

306
00:20:30,225 --> 00:20:32,005
Please come inside.

307
00:20:47,225 --> 00:20:49,005
Come, groom.

308
00:20:49,265 --> 00:20:50,601
Come, bride.

309
00:20:50,625 --> 00:20:52,041
Please do not make things difficult for me.

310
00:20:52,065 --> 00:20:53,641
I am only being paid to do my job.

311
00:20:53,665 --> 00:20:55,361
Father-in-law, Mother-in-law,

312
00:20:55,385 --> 00:20:57,081
I will take Fuzhi home now.

313
00:20:57,105 --> 00:20:58,445
Good.

314
00:20:59,185 --> 00:21:00,725
Come, Fuzhi.

315
00:21:05,905 --> 00:21:07,325
Let go of me!

316
00:21:08,945 --> 00:21:10,081
You...

317
00:21:10,105 --> 00:21:11,285
One of you feigned illness
to sell your daughter,

318
00:21:11,545 --> 00:21:13,161
and the other hides a knife
behind her smile.

319
00:21:13,185 --> 00:21:15,121
You joined forces to push
me into a living hell.

320
00:21:15,145 --> 00:21:17,601
Fuzhi, all our relatives
and friends are here.

321
00:21:17,625 --> 00:21:18,761
How can you say such things?

322
00:21:18,785 --> 00:21:20,161
-Fuzhi.
-And you!

323
00:21:20,185 --> 00:21:21,365
That day,

324
00:21:21,545 --> 00:21:22,641
at the Bofeng House,

325
00:21:22,665 --> 00:21:23,761
I should have killed you.

326
00:21:23,785 --> 00:21:26,401
Then you would not be
here to disgust me today.

327
00:21:26,425 --> 00:21:28,121
I am the legitimate heir
of the Song family.

328
00:21:28,145 --> 00:21:30,281
How would marrying me wrong you in any way?

329
00:21:30,305 --> 00:21:32,325
How dare you be so ungrateful?

330
00:21:34,265 --> 00:21:35,441
-Quickly, stop her!
-Let go of me!

331
00:21:35,465 --> 00:21:36,925
-Hurry!
-Quickly!

332
00:21:39,425 --> 00:21:40,841
Why are you so disobedient?

333
00:21:40,865 --> 00:21:41,841
Fuzhi,

334
00:21:41,865 --> 00:21:43,481
today is our wedding day.

335
00:21:43,505 --> 00:21:45,045
Do not even think about escaping.

336
00:21:45,865 --> 00:21:47,885
Father!

337
00:21:49,905 --> 00:21:52,125
-Please excuse this disgraceful scene.
-Let go of me!

338
00:21:53,185 --> 00:21:54,081
Father-in-law.

339
00:21:54,105 --> 00:21:55,161
Mother-in-law.

340
00:21:55,185 --> 00:21:56,721
I will take Fuzhi home now.

341
00:21:56,745 --> 00:21:57,641
Go. Hurry.

342
00:21:57,665 --> 00:21:58,925
-Move.
-Hurry.

343
00:21:59,345 --> 00:22:00,281
Father!

344
00:22:00,305 --> 00:22:01,445
Stop!

345
00:22:23,585 --> 00:22:24,885
Let me see

346
00:22:25,145 --> 00:22:26,445
who dares touch her today.

347
00:22:31,585 --> 00:22:33,725
Fuzhi, I am late.

348
00:22:39,985 --> 00:22:41,281
Governor Wang.

349
00:22:41,305 --> 00:22:43,441
Today is my daughter's wedding day.

350
00:22:43,465 --> 00:22:45,245
What are you doing?

351
00:22:45,505 --> 00:22:47,041
What crime has the Yan family committed

352
00:22:47,065 --> 00:22:48,525
to offend Young Lord Shen?

353
00:22:48,745 --> 00:22:51,001
He is the son of the current Grand Tutor,

354
00:22:51,025 --> 00:22:53,045
a renowned Imperial
Survey Envoy in the capital,

355
00:22:53,305 --> 00:22:55,801
and one of His Majesty's
closest confidants.

356
00:22:55,825 --> 00:22:57,001
I...

357
00:22:57,025 --> 00:22:58,241
I do not know.

358
00:22:58,265 --> 00:22:59,601
You do not know?

359
00:22:59,625 --> 00:23:01,321
Then allow me to question Master Yan.

360
00:23:01,345 --> 00:23:04,321
What crime deserves punishment for
forcing my betrothed wife to marry another man?

361
00:23:04,345 --> 00:23:05,765
What punishment do you deserve?

362
00:23:06,425 --> 00:23:07,601
Young Lord Shen,

363
00:23:07,625 --> 00:23:09,285
what do you mean by that?

364
00:23:12,105 --> 00:23:14,921
So this is Young Lord Shen's family matter.

365
00:23:14,945 --> 00:23:16,681
-Men.
-Here.

366
00:23:16,705 --> 00:23:19,041
Clear these irrelevant people out.

367
00:23:19,065 --> 00:23:20,205
-Yes.
-Yes.

368
00:23:21,945 --> 00:23:22,841
-Move along.
-Go.

369
00:23:22,865 --> 00:23:24,005
-Go.
-Go.

370
00:23:24,425 --> 00:23:25,605
Young Master Song,

371
00:23:26,185 --> 00:23:27,685
this way, please.

372
00:23:29,585 --> 00:23:30,885
I shall take my leave.

373
00:23:35,865 --> 00:23:37,001
Young Lord Shen,

374
00:23:37,025 --> 00:23:39,041
our Yan family and your Shen family

375
00:23:39,065 --> 00:23:40,321
have never discussed a marriage.

376
00:23:40,345 --> 00:23:41,361
Master Yan,

377
00:23:41,385 --> 00:23:42,801
Fuzhi and I love each other

378
00:23:42,825 --> 00:23:43,965
and privately pledged ourselves for life.

379
00:23:44,905 --> 00:23:46,921
We have already consummated
our relationship.

380
00:23:46,945 --> 00:23:48,725
-Consummated?
-Consummated?

381
00:23:49,985 --> 00:23:51,241
This is my fault.

382
00:23:51,265 --> 00:23:53,001
I was somewhat of a playboy before,

383
00:23:53,025 --> 00:23:54,321
so Fuzhi always had her concerns.

384
00:23:54,345 --> 00:23:55,481
But I swear,

385
00:23:55,505 --> 00:23:56,401
after meeting Fuzhi,

386
00:23:56,425 --> 00:23:58,245
there has been no one else in my heart.

387
00:24:01,385 --> 00:24:03,281
I intended to choose an auspicious day

388
00:24:03,305 --> 00:24:05,205
and personally bring
betrothal gifts to propose.

389
00:24:05,465 --> 00:24:07,845
I never expected Fuzhi to
suddenly return to Shazhou.

390
00:24:08,665 --> 00:24:10,285
Had I not come today,

391
00:24:10,585 --> 00:24:13,605
Fuzhi would already be the
Song family's bride, would she not?

392
00:24:15,465 --> 00:24:16,681
Young Lord Shen,

393
00:24:16,705 --> 00:24:19,521
had I known that you and
Fuzhi loved each other,

394
00:24:19,545 --> 00:24:21,681
the Song family would never
have entered the matter.

395
00:24:21,705 --> 00:24:23,881
Tomorrow, I will discuss
it with the Song family.

396
00:24:23,905 --> 00:24:24,801
Tomorrow?

397
00:24:24,825 --> 00:24:25,721
No.

398
00:24:25,745 --> 00:24:28,441
I will go cancel the engagement
with them immediately

399
00:24:28,465 --> 00:24:31,045
and return their betrothal gifts at once.

400
00:24:31,305 --> 00:24:32,201
In that case,

401
00:24:32,225 --> 00:24:33,961
Father-in-law, please rise.

402
00:24:33,985 --> 00:24:35,845
Thank you.

403
00:24:36,225 --> 00:24:37,481
Young Lord Shen,

404
00:24:37,505 --> 00:24:38,761
our Yan family

405
00:24:38,785 --> 00:24:40,925
is merely a merchant household.

406
00:24:41,105 --> 00:24:42,201
As for Fuzhi,

407
00:24:42,225 --> 00:24:43,121
she has little learning,

408
00:24:43,145 --> 00:24:44,201
and her temperament is stubborn.

409
00:24:44,225 --> 00:24:45,925
In family standing, appearance, and talent,

410
00:24:46,185 --> 00:24:47,561
she is unworthy of you in every respect.

411
00:24:47,585 --> 00:24:49,601
When you say you love Fuzhi,

412
00:24:49,625 --> 00:24:51,721
-could you merely be joking with us?
-Exactly.

413
00:24:51,745 --> 00:24:52,841
Madam Yan's words

414
00:24:52,865 --> 00:24:56,325
either belittle Fuzhi or
question my sincerity.

415
00:24:56,585 --> 00:24:58,321
Fuzhi is one of a kind in my heart.

416
00:24:58,345 --> 00:25:01,161
Family standing, appearance, and talent

417
00:25:01,185 --> 00:25:02,881
together cannot compare
with her importance to me.

418
00:25:02,905 --> 00:25:04,045
My feelings for Fuzhi

419
00:25:04,145 --> 00:25:05,765
are completely sincere.

420
00:25:06,385 --> 00:25:07,481
This is no jest.

421
00:25:07,505 --> 00:25:08,881
Since that is so,

422
00:25:08,905 --> 00:25:10,761
why do Young Lord Shen and Fuzhi not

423
00:25:10,785 --> 00:25:12,121
hold the wedding ceremony tonight?

424
00:25:12,145 --> 00:25:13,081
-No.
-Good.

425
00:25:13,105 --> 00:25:14,761
Madam Yan, with such an arrangement,

426
00:25:14,785 --> 00:25:17,361
do you intend for me to
marry into the Yan family?

427
00:25:17,385 --> 00:25:18,441
I would not dare.

428
00:25:18,465 --> 00:25:20,801
I only fear this may be a passing
whim for Young Lord Shen

429
00:25:20,825 --> 00:25:22,521
and that Fuzhi will suffer because of it.

430
00:25:22,545 --> 00:25:24,241
When I, Shen Zhishu, marry,

431
00:25:24,265 --> 00:25:25,801
not one of the Six Rites may be omitted,

432
00:25:25,825 --> 00:25:27,565
and all Three Letters must be prepared.

433
00:25:27,865 --> 00:25:29,561
When the auspicious day arrives,

434
00:25:29,585 --> 00:25:31,565
I will come with an
eight-bearer bridal sedan

435
00:25:31,905 --> 00:25:34,361
and marry Fuzhi grandly
into the Shen family.

436
00:25:34,385 --> 00:25:36,561
For Fuzhi to receive
Young Lord Shen's affection

437
00:25:36,585 --> 00:25:38,001
is truly her good fortune.

438
00:25:38,025 --> 00:25:39,841
My wife is narrow-minded and ignorant.

439
00:25:39,865 --> 00:25:42,525
Please forgive her, Young Lord Shen.

440
00:25:43,785 --> 00:25:45,205
You foolish woman.

441
00:25:45,465 --> 00:25:47,365
Hurry and apologize to Young Lord Shen.

442
00:25:49,865 --> 00:25:51,845
I was presumptuous.

443
00:25:52,785 --> 00:25:54,121
It is already late.

444
00:25:54,145 --> 00:25:55,201
I will order the servants

445
00:25:55,225 --> 00:25:56,361
to prepare a guest room

446
00:25:56,385 --> 00:25:58,681
so Young Lord Shen may rest early.

447
00:25:58,705 --> 00:25:59,845
Husband,

448
00:26:00,145 --> 00:26:02,241
since Young Lord Shen and Fuzhi

449
00:26:02,265 --> 00:26:03,441
have already consummated
their relationship,

450
00:26:03,465 --> 00:26:06,001
what harm is there in their sharing a bed?

451
00:26:06,025 --> 00:26:08,001
-Madam Yan, I...
-You two have been apart for so long.

452
00:26:08,025 --> 00:26:10,765
You must have much catching up to do.

453
00:26:10,985 --> 00:26:12,125
Xi'er.

454
00:26:13,185 --> 00:26:15,965
Quickly escort Fuzhi and
our son-in-law to their room.

455
00:26:17,065 --> 00:26:18,605
Go on.

456
00:26:23,665 --> 00:26:25,045
Madam,

457
00:26:25,665 --> 00:26:27,005
is this not a little...

458
00:26:41,585 --> 00:26:43,045
Official Meng.

459
00:26:43,305 --> 00:26:45,041
His Majesty has bestowed
this carriage upon you.

460
00:26:45,065 --> 00:26:46,121
From now on, whenever you
attend court or enter the palace,

461
00:26:46,145 --> 00:26:47,281
you may travel by carriage.

462
00:26:47,305 --> 00:26:48,565
Official Meng, please.

463
00:26:51,625 --> 00:26:53,125
Please tell His Majesty

464
00:26:53,345 --> 00:26:55,285
that I am deeply grateful
for his gracious favor.

465
00:26:56,105 --> 00:26:57,245
Today,

466
00:26:57,425 --> 00:26:59,201
I merely realized it had been
too long since I walked the market.

467
00:26:59,225 --> 00:27:00,561
I wished to take a stroll

468
00:27:00,585 --> 00:27:02,365
and purchase a few daily necessities.

469
00:27:03,425 --> 00:27:04,565
Official Meng,

470
00:27:05,545 --> 00:27:06,881
an imperial order cannot be disobeyed.

471
00:27:06,905 --> 00:27:08,645
Rumors are like the wind.

472
00:27:09,345 --> 00:27:11,445
If I become fearful
and timid because of them,

473
00:27:12,225 --> 00:27:14,765
would that not be exactly
what the rumor-mongers desire?

474
00:27:15,265 --> 00:27:16,281
I, Meng Tinghui,

475
00:27:16,305 --> 00:27:17,881
act uprightly and have nothing to hide.

476
00:27:17,905 --> 00:27:19,845
I have never feared being
seen wherever I walk.

477
00:27:20,385 --> 00:27:21,521
Imperial Guard Huang,

478
00:27:21,545 --> 00:27:23,401
repeat these words to His Majesty.

479
00:27:23,425 --> 00:27:24,765
He will not blame you.

480
00:27:43,065 --> 00:27:44,321
This rain never stops.

481
00:27:44,345 --> 00:27:45,601
We have not had a single customer.

482
00:27:45,625 --> 00:27:47,925
At this rate, we will soon
be lining up to live on air.

483
00:27:49,665 --> 00:27:51,125
Is that not Official Meng?

484
00:27:51,425 --> 00:27:52,401
After what happened,

485
00:27:52,425 --> 00:27:53,921
she still dressed so beautifully to go out.

486
00:27:53,945 --> 00:27:56,965
Is she not afraid people
will call her shameless?

487
00:27:57,345 --> 00:27:58,321
Shopkeeper,

488
00:27:58,345 --> 00:27:59,241
you have to admit,

489
00:27:59,265 --> 00:28:01,361
Official Meng is rather beautiful.

490
00:28:01,385 --> 00:28:02,965
Look at how pathetic you are.

491
00:28:03,625 --> 00:28:04,681
A demoness

492
00:28:04,705 --> 00:28:07,325
naturally has seductive tricks.

493
00:28:07,865 --> 00:28:09,321
Have you heard what happened that night?

494
00:28:09,345 --> 00:28:10,721
Someone saw it with his own eyes.

495
00:28:10,745 --> 00:28:12,761
She used her beauty to
seduce those two madmen,

496
00:28:12,785 --> 00:28:15,001
then drew lightning down upon one of them.

497
00:28:15,025 --> 00:28:16,321
There was a sudden crack,

498
00:28:16,345 --> 00:28:18,965
and the man was struck dead on the spot.

499
00:28:21,345 --> 00:28:23,721
Could she truly know witchcraft?

500
00:28:23,745 --> 00:28:24,921
Who knows?

501
00:28:24,945 --> 00:28:26,841
With the endless downpours lately,

502
00:28:26,865 --> 00:28:28,681
people say she summoned the rain.

503
00:28:28,705 --> 00:28:30,041
They say she bewitched the people

504
00:28:30,065 --> 00:28:31,685
and is an omen of great disaster.

505
00:28:32,905 --> 00:28:35,485
Greetings, Official Meng.

506
00:28:36,265 --> 00:28:37,481
Stop staring. Keep away from her.

507
00:28:37,505 --> 00:28:38,401
Do not invite trouble upon yourself.

508
00:28:38,425 --> 00:28:39,965
Do not say I did not warn you.

509
00:28:40,145 --> 00:28:41,285
Let's go.

510
00:28:41,985 --> 00:28:43,761
This rain simply will not stop.

511
00:28:43,785 --> 00:28:46,245
Going out is unbearably troublesome.

512
00:28:46,545 --> 00:28:48,285
Even the hem of my skirt is soaked.

513
00:28:49,225 --> 00:28:51,285
My birthday is the day after tomorrow.

514
00:28:51,545 --> 00:28:53,165
What terrible luck.

515
00:28:54,305 --> 00:28:56,005
Sister Wen, please
endure it a little longer.

516
00:28:56,265 --> 00:28:57,961
The rouge from Golden Powder Pavilion

517
00:28:57,985 --> 00:29:00,165
is among the finest in the capital.

518
00:29:00,465 --> 00:29:02,525
You will certainly need it
at your birthday banquet.

519
00:29:04,065 --> 00:29:05,761
Is that not Meng Tinghui?

520
00:29:05,785 --> 00:29:07,041
Why has she come out too?

521
00:29:07,065 --> 00:29:09,081
She does not seem afraid of the rain.

522
00:29:09,105 --> 00:29:11,641
Then again, what does she
have left to care about?

523
00:29:11,665 --> 00:29:14,361
One look at her attire reveals
her improper intentions.

524
00:29:14,385 --> 00:29:15,881
Her reputation is already ruined,

525
00:29:15,905 --> 00:29:17,485
yet she still dares parade
through the streets.

526
00:29:17,745 --> 00:29:19,041
Some people

527
00:29:19,065 --> 00:29:20,841
must imagine that using this rouge

528
00:29:20,865 --> 00:29:22,841
will turn a sparrow into a phoenix.

529
00:29:22,865 --> 00:29:24,041
In terms of beauty,

530
00:29:24,065 --> 00:29:26,321
she cannot compare with even
a fraction of Sister Wen.

531
00:29:26,345 --> 00:29:27,761
What does it matter if a woman
becomes an official?

532
00:29:27,785 --> 00:29:29,801
Marrying well is the
true measure of ability.

533
00:29:29,825 --> 00:29:31,205
Exactly.

534
00:29:38,985 --> 00:29:40,125
Shopkeeper,

535
00:29:40,465 --> 00:29:41,721
this rouge is excellent.

536
00:29:41,745 --> 00:29:43,485
I will take the entire batch.

537
00:29:45,105 --> 00:29:47,041
You ladies possess noble status,

538
00:29:47,065 --> 00:29:48,961
yet your words are so vicious.

539
00:29:48,985 --> 00:29:50,201
Are you not afraid of
disgracing yourselves?

540
00:29:50,225 --> 00:29:51,761
The guilt belongs to the perpetrator,

541
00:29:51,785 --> 00:29:53,441
not the victim.

542
00:29:53,465 --> 00:29:55,805
Let me see who still dares
take pleasure in another's pain,

543
00:29:56,065 --> 00:29:57,441
turn right and wrong upside down,

544
00:29:57,465 --> 00:29:58,921
and spread falsehoods as truth.

545
00:29:58,945 --> 00:30:00,405
Well said.

546
00:30:02,025 --> 00:30:03,761
Those who judge people by their rouge

547
00:30:03,785 --> 00:30:05,201
and morality by their clothing

548
00:30:05,225 --> 00:30:06,561
are truly shallow.

549
00:30:06,585 --> 00:30:08,361
Those who judge heroes by birth

550
00:30:08,385 --> 00:30:09,721
and success by marriage

551
00:30:09,745 --> 00:30:11,445
are nothing more than frogs
at the bottom of a well.

552
00:30:13,025 --> 00:30:14,765
A summer insect cannot
comprehend winter ice.

553
00:30:14,985 --> 00:30:16,885
There is no need to waste words on them.

554
00:30:21,345 --> 00:30:23,205
I refuse to use the same rouge as them.

555
00:30:23,305 --> 00:30:24,445
I am not buying it.

556
00:30:28,665 --> 00:30:29,805
Zhili.

557
00:30:30,625 --> 00:30:31,885
Miss Situ.

558
00:30:32,385 --> 00:30:34,045
Thank you both for helping me today.

559
00:30:34,665 --> 00:30:35,841
You are too courteous, Official Meng.

560
00:30:35,865 --> 00:30:37,365
It was only a small effort.

561
00:30:37,705 --> 00:30:39,921
I doubt this rain will stop anytime soon.

562
00:30:39,945 --> 00:30:41,601
My Huiyin House is nearby,

563
00:30:41,625 --> 00:30:42,881
and offers a form of musical therapy.

564
00:30:42,905 --> 00:30:45,841
Would you both honor me by trying it?

565
00:30:45,865 --> 00:30:47,965
I have long heard of it.
It would be my pleasure.

566
00:30:49,065 --> 00:30:50,965
My brother has mentioned it to me as well.

567
00:30:51,225 --> 00:30:52,645
I have been meaning to visit.

568
00:30:53,265 --> 00:30:54,405
Please.

569
00:31:15,225 --> 00:31:16,405
-You...
-Go ahead.

570
00:31:19,825 --> 00:31:21,805
-You speak.
-You should go first.

571
00:31:22,745 --> 00:31:25,165
-Are you still nervous?
-Why would I be nervous?

572
00:31:26,825 --> 00:31:28,485
Then your hand...

573
00:31:32,465 --> 00:31:33,361
Well...

574
00:31:33,385 --> 00:31:35,561
Has the sky torn open?

575
00:31:35,585 --> 00:31:37,125
The rain simply will not end.

576
00:31:37,945 --> 00:31:40,285
All of Great Ning is now
troubled by these storms.

577
00:31:40,865 --> 00:31:42,685
If this continues,

578
00:31:43,545 --> 00:31:45,281
the people's lives will become unbearable.

579
00:31:45,305 --> 00:31:46,725
Then...

580
00:31:48,025 --> 00:31:49,685
why have you come to Shazhou?

581
00:31:52,105 --> 00:31:53,561
I am handling a matter for His Majesty.

582
00:31:53,585 --> 00:31:55,601
I had some free time and stopped
at the Bofeng House in Shazhou.

583
00:31:55,625 --> 00:31:57,761
By chance, I saw Haitang
leaving to deliver a letter

584
00:31:57,785 --> 00:31:58,921
and being stopped by several people.

585
00:31:58,945 --> 00:32:00,245
After I intervened,

586
00:32:01,665 --> 00:32:03,005
I learned from her

587
00:32:03,425 --> 00:32:04,725
about your situation.

588
00:32:04,985 --> 00:32:07,041
I wrote a secret letter

589
00:32:07,065 --> 00:32:09,761
and asked Haitang to
find someone to rescue me.

590
00:32:09,785 --> 00:32:11,205
She must have

591
00:32:11,665 --> 00:32:13,725
been watched by my stepmother's people.

592
00:32:15,265 --> 00:32:16,641
Fortunately, you came today.

593
00:32:16,665 --> 00:32:17,925
Otherwise...

594
00:32:19,025 --> 00:32:20,561
You always seem carefree,

595
00:32:20,585 --> 00:32:21,841
overbearing, and unruly.

596
00:32:21,865 --> 00:32:24,085
I never imagined you
grew up in such a household.

597
00:32:27,185 --> 00:32:28,961
It is nothing more than having

598
00:32:28,985 --> 00:32:30,605
a stubborn and snobbish father,

599
00:32:31,225 --> 00:32:32,721
as well as

600
00:32:32,745 --> 00:32:35,281
a stepmother with the face
of a saint and the heart of a serpent.

601
00:32:35,305 --> 00:32:36,841
And a mischievous, troublesome stepbrother.

602
00:32:36,865 --> 00:32:38,285
I became accustomed to them long ago.

603
00:32:39,545 --> 00:32:40,685
Does it still hurt?

604
00:32:42,145 --> 00:32:43,285
No.

605
00:33:07,305 --> 00:33:08,725
I will be gentler.

606
00:33:12,265 --> 00:33:14,801
You are still the daughter of one
of Shazhou's great households.

607
00:33:14,825 --> 00:33:16,001
For most other women,

608
00:33:16,025 --> 00:33:17,685
marriage would not be a bad choice.

609
00:33:18,105 --> 00:33:19,761
Why do you resist it so strongly?

610
00:33:19,785 --> 00:33:20,761
What would you understand?

611
00:33:20,785 --> 00:33:23,965
Half the reason I went to the capital
was to accompany Mengmeng,

612
00:33:24,225 --> 00:33:26,201
but the other half was
for my own ambitions.

613
00:33:26,225 --> 00:33:27,605
I love doing business.

614
00:33:30,745 --> 00:33:32,121
Everyone says

615
00:33:32,145 --> 00:33:34,561
a woman should remain at home,
support her husband, and raise children.

616
00:33:34,585 --> 00:33:35,965
I refuse.

617
00:33:36,225 --> 00:33:37,401
I intend to open Bofeng Houses

618
00:33:37,425 --> 00:33:38,761
throughout all of Great Ning.

619
00:33:38,785 --> 00:33:40,845
I will build a world of my own.

620
00:33:41,145 --> 00:33:42,281
Besides,

621
00:33:42,305 --> 00:33:43,725
even if I do marry,

622
00:33:44,065 --> 00:33:45,521
I will find someone

623
00:33:45,545 --> 00:33:46,801
who shares mutual love with me

624
00:33:46,825 --> 00:33:48,761
and truly understands my heart.

625
00:33:48,785 --> 00:33:50,321
We will earn money together,

626
00:33:50,345 --> 00:33:51,961
travel through mountains
and rivers together,

627
00:33:51,985 --> 00:33:54,005
and live a warm, ordinary life.

628
00:33:56,745 --> 00:33:57,885
I see.

629
00:33:59,665 --> 00:34:01,525
I never truly understood you before.

630
00:34:05,665 --> 00:34:06,801
I am so tired.

631
00:34:06,825 --> 00:34:08,201
Father locked me up for three days.

632
00:34:08,225 --> 00:34:09,881
At last, I can sleep properly.

633
00:34:09,905 --> 00:34:11,565
But...

634
00:34:12,225 --> 00:34:13,281
there is only one bed.

635
00:34:13,305 --> 00:34:14,361
We...

636
00:34:14,385 --> 00:34:15,441
I nearly forgot.

637
00:34:15,465 --> 00:34:17,321
Young Lord Shen is delicate and precious.

638
00:34:17,345 --> 00:34:19,001
You may sleep on the bed tonight.

639
00:34:19,025 --> 00:34:20,041
I will sleep on the floor.

640
00:34:20,065 --> 00:34:21,681
I am a grown man.

641
00:34:21,705 --> 00:34:24,041
How could I let a frail
woman sleep on the floor?

642
00:34:24,065 --> 00:34:25,961
You sleep on the bed. I will...

643
00:34:25,985 --> 00:34:27,681
Fuzhi, are you asleep?

644
00:34:27,705 --> 00:34:29,045
I will open the door.

645
00:35:04,145 --> 00:35:05,441
Why did you hit me?

646
00:35:05,465 --> 00:35:07,441
-Did you not ask me to act with you?
-I asked you to act,

647
00:35:07,465 --> 00:35:09,801
-not lose yourself in the role.
-I lost myself?

648
00:35:09,825 --> 00:35:11,205
You closed your eyes.

649
00:35:12,665 --> 00:35:13,601
I was helping you escape the situation.

650
00:35:13,625 --> 00:35:14,681
You, on the other hand,

651
00:35:14,705 --> 00:35:16,521
had better not harbor
improper thoughts about me.

652
00:35:16,545 --> 00:35:17,441
I...

653
00:35:17,465 --> 00:35:18,605
You are imagining things.

654
00:35:18,865 --> 00:35:20,801
I was afraid my stepmother
would discover the truth.

655
00:35:20,825 --> 00:35:22,405
You still used me as a shield.

656
00:35:23,705 --> 00:35:26,285
It was an emergency. Forgive the offense.

657
00:35:33,225 --> 00:35:34,725
Was that your first kiss?

658
00:35:38,625 --> 00:35:40,161
How could it be?

659
00:35:40,185 --> 00:35:42,201
Go ask around the capital.

660
00:35:42,225 --> 00:35:43,121
I, Shen Zhishu,

661
00:35:43,145 --> 00:35:45,085
have never lacked beautiful companions.

662
00:35:45,345 --> 00:35:46,801
Girls throughout the capital

663
00:35:46,825 --> 00:35:49,041
are always throwing themselves at me.

664
00:35:49,065 --> 00:35:50,445
I have always

665
00:35:50,705 --> 00:35:52,521
passed through countless blossoms

666
00:35:52,545 --> 00:35:54,685
and sampled every tender beauty.

667
00:35:57,385 --> 00:35:58,641
Then why is your face red?

668
00:35:58,665 --> 00:35:59,561
It is not.

669
00:35:59,585 --> 00:36:00,725
I...

670
00:36:02,025 --> 00:36:03,041
This...

671
00:36:03,065 --> 00:36:04,645
This room is simply too warm.

672
00:36:04,825 --> 00:36:06,401
In that case,

673
00:36:06,425 --> 00:36:07,681
there is no need for me
to take responsibility

674
00:36:07,705 --> 00:36:09,085
for that impulsive kiss.

675
00:36:11,265 --> 00:36:12,681
Who needs you to take responsibility?

676
00:36:12,705 --> 00:36:13,961
A kiss that bland

677
00:36:13,985 --> 00:36:15,281
will be completely forgotten

678
00:36:15,305 --> 00:36:16,445
when I wake tomorrow.

679
00:36:17,425 --> 00:36:18,321
That is excellent.

680
00:36:18,345 --> 00:36:19,801
My stepmother

681
00:36:19,825 --> 00:36:20,961
is extremely suspicious.

682
00:36:20,985 --> 00:36:24,201
So tonight, I may have
to trouble Young Lord Shen

683
00:36:24,225 --> 00:36:25,365
to share this bed with me.

684
00:36:25,745 --> 00:36:28,681
-Do I also have to...
-Keep your voice down. You startled me.

685
00:36:28,705 --> 00:36:30,641
Must I make such a great sacrifice?

686
00:36:30,665 --> 00:36:31,721
We must see the
performance through to the end.

687
00:36:31,745 --> 00:36:33,285
You should finish the good deed you began.

688
00:36:34,825 --> 00:36:35,965
I am tired.

689
00:36:58,585 --> 00:37:00,165
You need not come under the quilt.

690
00:37:01,865 --> 00:37:03,005
I...

691
00:37:20,585 --> 00:37:21,765
I am rather tired too.

692
00:37:30,185 --> 00:37:31,325
Miss Yan.

693
00:38:09,945 --> 00:38:11,601
Torrential rain has continued
in Liangzhou for seven days,

694
00:38:11,625 --> 00:38:12,841
and water is beginning to flood the cities.

695
00:38:12,865 --> 00:38:14,041
The dikes in Qingzhou have burst,

696
00:38:14,065 --> 00:38:14,961
submerging the surrounding farmland.

697
00:38:14,985 --> 00:38:16,001
An urgent report has arrived from Jizhou.

698
00:38:16,025 --> 00:38:17,725
Starving refugees are
already blocking the main roads.

699
00:38:18,105 --> 00:38:19,325
Issue my decree.

700
00:38:19,505 --> 00:38:21,361
Order the Ministry of Works to
produce dredging equipment overnight

701
00:38:21,385 --> 00:38:22,801
and distribute it according to
the flood conditions in each prefecture.

702
00:38:22,825 --> 00:38:24,321
The Ministry of War will
mobilize 30,000 Imperial Guards

703
00:38:24,345 --> 00:38:26,361
to dredge waterways and
reinforce vulnerable dikes without delay.

704
00:38:26,385 --> 00:38:27,521
The Ministry of Revenue

705
00:38:27,545 --> 00:38:29,121
may recruit disaster victims
to dredge the waterways

706
00:38:29,145 --> 00:38:30,281
and pay them according
to the work completed.

707
00:38:30,305 --> 00:38:31,565
Establish porridge stations
throughout the affected regions

708
00:38:31,905 --> 00:38:32,881
so the elderly, women, and children

709
00:38:32,905 --> 00:38:34,205
may receive two meals of porridge each day.

710
00:38:34,465 --> 00:38:35,605
Yes.

711
00:38:35,825 --> 00:38:37,721
Your Majesty,

712
00:38:37,745 --> 00:38:39,765
you must take care of your health.

713
00:38:39,825 --> 00:38:41,841
At such a late hour and in such weather,

714
00:38:41,865 --> 00:38:43,281
how can you continue exhausting yourself?

715
00:38:43,305 --> 00:38:44,281
Huang Bo,

716
00:38:44,305 --> 00:38:45,241
as an Imperial Guard,

717
00:38:45,265 --> 00:38:47,441
you should place His Majesty's
health above all else.

718
00:38:47,465 --> 00:38:48,605
Chief Steward You.

719
00:38:48,865 --> 00:38:50,481
Look at this rain.

720
00:38:50,505 --> 00:38:52,801
Will it ease even slightly
because I go to sleep?

721
00:38:52,825 --> 00:38:54,445
Will the dikes in Qingzhou

722
00:38:54,665 --> 00:38:57,001
collapse any more slowly
because the hour is late?

723
00:38:57,025 --> 00:38:58,041
But I...

724
00:38:58,065 --> 00:38:59,961
Huang Bo, carry out the orders immediately.

725
00:38:59,985 --> 00:39:01,405
Yes.

726
00:39:04,585 --> 00:39:05,765
Judging by this rain,

727
00:39:06,265 --> 00:39:07,161
there seems to be

728
00:39:07,185 --> 00:39:09,605
no sign of it stopping.

729
00:39:29,145 --> 00:39:30,481
What are you doing?

730
00:39:30,505 --> 00:39:33,005
I... I did not react in time.

731
00:39:33,385 --> 00:39:34,685
Do you know

732
00:39:34,865 --> 00:39:37,765
how many times I tossed and
turned last night before finally sleeping?

733
00:39:38,025 --> 00:39:39,725
You did not sleep all night?

734
00:39:40,345 --> 00:39:43,565
Young Lord Shen, are you awake?

735
00:39:45,665 --> 00:39:47,245
We are awake.

736
00:39:51,785 --> 00:39:53,441
Just now, from outside,

737
00:39:53,465 --> 00:39:55,641
I heard quite a commotion in the room.

738
00:39:55,665 --> 00:39:58,241
No matter how much
Young Lord Shen cherishes Fuzhi,

739
00:39:58,265 --> 00:40:00,325
you must still take care of your health.

740
00:40:00,785 --> 00:40:01,801
So,

741
00:40:01,825 --> 00:40:03,361
I specially prepared a
nourishing tonic soup.

742
00:40:03,385 --> 00:40:04,641
It contains

743
00:40:04,665 --> 00:40:07,725
-ginseng, deer antler, cinnamon...
-He does not need that.

744
00:40:07,905 --> 00:40:09,565
Take it back and drink it yourself.

745
00:40:10,985 --> 00:40:13,165
Then you may drink it later.

746
00:40:14,025 --> 00:40:16,165
I will leave you now.

747
00:40:18,305 --> 00:40:19,601
Miss.

748
00:40:19,625 --> 00:40:21,881
An urgent letter has arrived from
the capital. It seems important.

749
00:40:21,905 --> 00:40:23,045
The capital?

750
00:40:27,065 --> 00:40:28,521
(Official Meng was attacked by two thugs.)

751
00:40:28,545 --> 00:40:30,645
(She escaped unharmed,
but malicious rumors are spreading.)

752
00:40:31,985 --> 00:40:33,325
It is Mengmeng.

753
00:40:34,785 --> 00:40:36,405
Something has happened to Mengmeng.

754
00:40:36,985 --> 00:40:37,881
We will leave at once

755
00:40:37,905 --> 00:40:39,001
and ride through the
night back to the capital.

756
00:40:39,025 --> 00:40:40,285
All right.

757
00:40:51,625 --> 00:40:54,161
Your Majesty, this man has confessed.

758
00:40:54,185 --> 00:40:55,805
He was indeed acting under
orders from the Tiger Roar Gang.

759
00:40:56,025 --> 00:40:57,165
Your Majesty,

760
00:40:57,425 --> 00:40:58,565
spare my life!

